# Read by `bun fmt` (bunfig.toml [fmt]).

# Markdown is hand-wrapped prose, and its tables are read by tests and by
# people in a terminal. Prettier's Markdown pass rewrites *emphasis* as
# _emphasis_ across hundreds of lines and moves list continuations, and buys
# nothing a reader of the source would notice. It also covers CLAUDE.md, whose
# Next.js block `next dev` rewrites, and docs/releases/, whose files must match
# the release notes already published on GitHub byte for byte.
*.md

# Other tools' files, in the formats those tools write.
.codex/
.opencode/
.claude/
